        "激活或刷新<Term:1000030></Term>状态时，希格莉德的暴击率提升<span style=\"color:#2BAD00;\">(33%/39%/44%/50%/55%/61%/66%)</span>，持续<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">8</span>秒；重复触发时持续时间延长<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">8</span>秒，最多不超过<span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\">40</span>秒；",
